<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 25.</p>
<p>				  June 25/June 24  June 25/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.15		 7.28</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.04		 5.73</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.23		10.26</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    2.28		50.76</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.45		32.34</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.46		32.81</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.18		14.21</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.51		29.81</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.61		40.32</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.51		38.96</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.47		23.70</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.83		90.80</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,336,505,570,319</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,953,842,452,839</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,051,340,895,893</p>
<p>  International funds			    97,242,760,606</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    234,079,460,891</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
